### Funciona com a extensão "REST Client" (VS Code) ou o HTTP Client do JetBrains.
### Rode `python -m app.seed` antes e cole os tokens/ids nas variáveis.
@host = http://localhost:8000

### 1) Login admin (demo)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@astrokatu.dev", "password": "demo1234"}

### 2) Login clínico
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "clinico@astrokatu.dev", "password": "demo1234"}

### 3) Login astronauta
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "astro1@astrokatu.dev", "password": "demo1234"}

###
@admin_token = COLE_AQUI
@clin_token = COLE_AQUI
@astro_token = COLE_AQUI
@astro_id = COLE_AQUI

### 4) Cenários disponíveis
GET {{host}}/admin/scenarios
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 5) Simular deterioração integrada (seed fixa => demo reproduzível)
POST {{host}}/admin/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenario": "integrated_deterioration", "user_id": "{{astro_id}}", "seed": 42}

### 6) Fila de revisão do clínico
GET {{host}}/clinician/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{clin_token}}

### 7) Timeline com baseline (para o gráfico sombreado)
GET {{host}}/clinician/users/{{astro_id}}/timeline?days=45
Authorization: Bearer {{clin_token}}

### 8) Revisão humana de um alerta
POST {{host}}/clinician/alerts/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{clin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "confirmed", "note": "Contato realizado."}

### 9) Plano de ações (visão do astronauta)
GET {{host}}/users/{{astro_id}}/action-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{astro_token}}

### 10) Diário: texto cru é REJEITADO (422), só features passam
POST {{host}}/entries/diary
Authorization: Bearer {{astro_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": "2026-11-14T21:00:00Z",
  "text_hash": "9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08",
  "local_model_version": "minilm-clf-0.3",
  "consent": true,
  "features": {
    "neg_emotion_score": 0.62, "pos_emotion_score": 0.21, "stress_score": 0.71,
    "loneliness_score": 0.44, "anhedonia_score": 0.30,
    "suicidal_ideation_flag": 0.02, "suicidal_ideation_confidence": "low",
    "text_length": 412, "complexity": 0.58, "topic_tags": ["sono", "trabalho"]
  }
}

### 11) Revogar consentimento do diário
POST {{host}}/users/{{astro_id}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{astro_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"diary": false}
